{
  "_why": "NOELLE'S RUN IS LOCKED TO THIS LIST (24 Nov 2026; #573's rule, every claude run a script starts is locked). scripts/ops/noelle.sh writes it into ~/Work/noelle/.claude/settings.json every run (__HOME__ and __REPO__ filled in) and runs her with --permission-mode dontAsk --setting-sources= --settings <that file>: none of Sequoia's own settings load, anything not allowed here is refused and ends her run as NAMED STOP [PERMISSION_DENIED]. Builder-level tools plus her own (noelle-tool, land-after, one reviewer Agent, web reads). Agent (and its old name Task, whose deny would remove the Agent tool) is allowed ONLY because her guard (the '*' hook below, scripts/ops/noelle-guard.mjs) refuses every agent but one fresh reviewer per PR she opened; scripts/validate/claude-runs-locked.mjs fails the build if Agent is allowed without that hook. additionalDirectories: her worktrees (~/GitHub), the skills she reads by path and her run folders; dontAsk refuses any path outside her home and these (~/Brains only through noelle-tool).",
